WEBVTT

00:04:57.024 --> 00:05:00.450
And when you make that discovery
about yourself, what you really desire,

00:05:00.474 --> 00:05:02.101
the desires to the heart and soul,

00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:04.142
then you're ready for the second mountain,

00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:07.088
because you realize only spiritual food
is going to fill that:

00:05:07.112 --> 00:05:09.080
"I've got to live a very different life."

00:05:09.104 --> 00:05:12.783
CA: I mean, one challenge
I'm sure that you have faced or will face

00:05:12.807 --> 00:05:16.713
is that people find it hard to talk
about this second mountain.

00:05:16.737 --> 00:05:21.126
The first mountain, the currency
is stuff that's out there.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:24.682
It's literally the currency,
what you're earning, what you're making,

00:05:24.706 --> 00:05:28.840
how much you're achieving as an employee
or social entrepreneur or whatever,

00:05:28.864 --> 00:05:31.465
and it's the obvious things
that you can see.